{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_synopsis", "source_sha256": "73d2ac417356673f51613f3e324dbb7776474428674c7b374baf450636c4d039", "ja": "次の公演は劇場のみんなで作る全体公演！\n自分たち自身の手で最高の公演にしようと、\nアイドル達は大はりきり。時に脱線しながら\nも自主的に準備を進め、見事に公演を成功さ\nせて、また新たな目標に向かっていく。", "zh": "下次的公演为剧场全员亲手打造的全体公演！\n偶像们都卯足干劲，要亲手打造最棒的公演。\n虽然她们偶尔会搞错方向，仍积极主动筹备，\n让公演顺利成功，并再次朝新的目标迈进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1000_null", "source_sha256": "f01f3d447378ced21494a5ca52840c4f7e6aefdbf993d9e7144d1c4d8841e0c3", "ja": "―翌日―", "zh": "──隔天──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1001_p", "source_sha256": "948725f9fdb8e0c56af674710a0eeab4f5667296e571beeb54c615b75bd34ba0", "ja": "ふたりとも悪いな。今日は休みだっていうのに、\n手伝ってもらっちゃって……。", "zh": "不好意思，今天明明是假日，\n却麻烦你们来帮忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "d47c14749d47575cd8c312ed112e290f0edfbec3a584841bf0f1cd432ce7b6dd", "ja": "気にしないでください♪　{$P$}さん\nひとりでこんなにたくさんの買い出し、大変ですから！", "zh": "请不用放在心上♪{$P$}先生，\n一个人要去采购这么多东西，实在是太辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "5aadbd06c895b753d743d02dcac5ddd3cda4a7426f8e4bc263b0eca91cd91153", "ja": "そうですよ。それに今日は、私達アイドルが、\nお互いに親睦を深めるための会……なんですよね？", "zh": "就是说啊，而且今天是为了让我们这些偶像\n加深彼此情谊，才办这个聚会的……我没说错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7fcc5266a12ae8134caa03e165bb954c13aa9a7094e41f7c66834b155a574ddc", "ja": "はい。毎回全員は無理でも……これからはこうして、\n定期的にみんなで集まれる会を開きたいと思って。", "zh": "是啊。虽然不太可能每次所有人都参加……\n但我希望以后能像这样，定期招集大家举办聚会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "81c1d34cd2443f7163dcb9bc7a1ba31442d0e3151bf022ee416ab5680aa68724", "ja": "劇場は人が多いですからね！\n私も、腕の奮い甲斐がありますよ～♪", "zh": "毕竟剧场的人很多嘛！\n这样我也下厨也会很有动力～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1006_p", "source_sha256": "92498b5e174b7643d8e407361441eedd0b93f5d5f202daaf897cac5be9bd1ad8", "ja": "ありがとう、美奈子。\n料理を一手に引き受けてくれて、本当に助かるよ。", "zh": "谢谢你，美奈子。\n你愿意负责料理，真的是帮了我一个大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "91979576a050ec5b33de2e95218c00e599a9958a9fb101e04e044e3c1b9d9a30", "ja": "いいえ♪　……あっ。このトマト、お安いですね！\n買っておきましょうっ！", "zh": "不客气♪啊，这个番茄好便宜喔！\n买一些吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "777c5a06dccacc55dd534f3ed3e08502157a6bbbaf601dfd303a5a54baa95f3c", "ja": "あとは……あっ、あっちのキャベツも！\n玉ねぎとじゃがいもは、長持ちしますしね！", "zh": "还有……啊，那边的高丽菜也是！\n洋葱和马铃薯也买一些，毕竟很耐放嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "264e2ee344f898779318a3abc1aaea959e62647e1521fe2306df8da33a998d56", "ja": "ふふっ。美奈子ちゃん、いいお嫁さんになりそう！\nそう思いませんか、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "呵呵，感觉美奈子以后会是个贤妻良母呢！\n你不觉得吗，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1010_p", "source_sha256": "097ec7b294fcdfcc0707784c51be5ebadd7deb093f9d3dc62ea3077029380f26", "ja": "はは、そうですね。\n将来美奈子と結婚する人は、幸せだろうな。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。\n将来能和美奈子结婚的人，一定会很幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "a45bdf142af2b03036e4bad55d18492d8f008453ec61a614261df8043a931d23", "ja": "ええっ！？　も、も～、お嫁さんだなんて、そんな～！\nふたりとも、気が早いですよ～っ。", "zh": "咦咦！？讨、讨厌啦～说什么贤妻良母啊～！\n你们这话也说太早了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "47a53b1248d172fdb448f91b2438a7629ee05b16614ec5149af8151c2c588a54", "ja": "そりゃあ私だって、歌織さんみたいな\n大人の女性になれたら、少しは考えますけど……。", "zh": "要是我能变成像歌织姊那样成熟的女性，\n我倒是可以考虑一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "fc13897b4ab47f430307a7bb5aa82b1a3cfcbbf2a20675bba147463844a79a78", "ja": "わ、私？　そんな……私なんて、\n自分でがっかりするぐらい子どもなのに……。", "zh": "我、我吗？你过奖了……\n我根本还不够成熟，甚至对自己感到失望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "aaeaa92e11fd843f9c9c00159e8bfc650756ff96124cb8a393d54b7c2421d1d7", "ja": "あっ、でもその前に……。", "zh": "啊，不过在那之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "ff9daedd435773fb38f750a3fa25720b1e8d2f7f1c13a6a2248bd39b142e6dd7", "ja": "お嫁さんの前に、私達が目指さなくちゃいけないのは。\n一人前のアイドル、ですねっ！", "zh": "在成为贤妻良母前，我们还有一个必须达成的目标。\n就是独当一面的偶像，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "bba687346a53f7270bd65fc78a234d555f59d974d7f07c2613a4c584a69dfee5", "ja": "まぁ……。\nふふっ、そうね。そっちが先ね！", "zh": "是啊……\n呵呵，说得也是，得先完成那个目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "db3cd0b575eab1bbf176f593740e7d684e7946176b9f08ead1eac29d10a9743d", "ja": "それまでは、私達のこと、よろしくお願いしますね！\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "在那天到来之前，我们就要麻烦你照顾啰！\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4e5cfc5350be5afba9bb7949cbabf42ceb86bb91188dae3ed2e646b46ae33d28", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\nしっかり見させてもらうよ！", "zh": "嗯，当然。\n我会好好看着你们的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "ef681b388f2bea246671e97c09a1f314b8ebdfd5a2edef39575c08df2be520fd", "ja": "それじゃ私達、キッチンで準備してます！\n楽しみにしててくださいね～？", "zh": "那我们先去厨房做准备！\n请你好好期待喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
