{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1023_p", "source_sha256": "311a4cbfd739ebd0a06fa68fbabac193ec21a154a3f7ea8550683a605f069bae", "ja": "（さて、こっちには誰か来ているかな……ん？\n話し声が聞こえてくるぞ）", "zh": "（好了，这边有谁已经到了呢……嗯？\n有人在说话的声音。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "dc5d9913fd47918ca6f0a9337faf7cbc4af4e7e0d188eb7e3b5d1d67827f801d", "ja": "紬さん！　昨日のライブ、とっても楽しかったですね！\n全員で、わたし達みんなの歌が歌えて……。", "zh": "小䌷姊姊！昨天的演唱会好开心喔！\n可以所有人一起唱我们大家的歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "7251c113af65e658b39296c39165f5bdf9b8caa77317870d4692a2010badbaa8", "ja": "本当に素敵なライブでした！　わたし、\nまたみなさんと一緒に、あんなライブがしたいです！", "zh": "真的是场好棒的演唱会！\n我还想要再和大家一起办那样的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "f906d0908cc698e69251d6f88f89b85456dd2f33aba2ce6c09d309e5ba19e885", "ja": "あ、あの……紬さん？\nわたし、何か変なことを言ったでしょうか……？", "zh": "那、那个……小䌷姊姊？\n我说了什么奇怪的话吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f49da695320731ff244ea1bf9530240a97baa1bb7211171413e98c5637b3a0fc", "ja": "え？　……ああ、ごめんなさい。\nそういうことではありません……。", "zh": "咦？啊啊，抱歉……\n不是这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7b3be4bf2ad49a79f72520fc8c00136e68723e260718a4c65ae41218d84b9af7", "ja": "その……箱崎さんは、とても……\n素直な方だと思って……。", "zh": "我只是在想……那个，\n箱崎真是个非常……率直的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "4ebbaf0730a8a37316d2e2bd8502d73c1a36a8218a06bdd305cd8f753652653d", "ja": "？？？\n素直……ですか？", "zh": "？？？\n率直……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4f808d93bca73073cea881542bb7e06f5128d2fdf945ca00ff9a8614f7df02a4", "ja": "ええと……何と言うか……。", "zh": "嗯……该怎么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c8417ff35dbc3f15121a2de33bb9c1c7c36b94b5c87da0c25c5861127076befa", "ja": "……うぅ、上手くゆえんげん……。\nけど……。", "zh": "……唔唔，我不会解释啦……\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1034_p", "source_sha256": "23af3cea9c5f75c54a6288741f8e4988477ac2a9203b17525011b710de5cf8f9", "ja": "（紬……）", "zh": "（紬……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8c2035ae8b3694a3122e5d64061f4a06adc50ecd429ea6b181e6096dbd5d2610", "ja": "は、箱崎さん。", "zh": "箱、箱崎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_010_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "74f5c3c7c10c57771fd2a8a435be5b388e6ddd6693feb8a793fdd47bb012db32", "ja": "は、はいっ！", "zh": "是、是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
